	'k005922bd' => 'Colour matching carried out at our Verfstraat counter is always free of charge. For homeowners seeking detailed advice on site, Amara Osei conducts in-home colour match visits across Rotterdam for €45, which is fully deducted from paint and wallpaper orders over €200. Custom 100 ml sample pots are €6 each. Once your recipe is approved, we mix full tins of House Matt (2.5 L for €58), Wood &amp; Metal Eggshell (1 L for €34), or Lime Wash (2.5 L for €46). Orders are ready for collection in 2 hours or delivered locally for €9, free over €150.',
	'k0129f576' => 'Our journal exists to record the daily lessons learned at our Verfstraat counter and on decorating sites across Rotterdam. Rather than discussing fleeting seasonal fashion, we write about durable materials, pigment behaviour, and how architectural light alters paint film. Here you will find detailed accounts of real projects, including our lime-wash application over old emulsion in a Noord rental flat and wallpaper quantity calculations for steep staircases in Delfshaven. We explain how our team approaches tricky architectural surfaces and why careful preparation saves time and paint.',
	'k0385a0c8' => 'At Toso Paints, our shelves are divided between architectural paints mixed to order and tactile wall coverings ordered by the roll. We keep our selection deliberately focused, stocking finishes that have proven their durability on real plaster, timber, and masonry. Rather than offering thousands of pre-canned retail options, every tin of paint is tinted at our Verfstraat counter to match your specific room conditions. Whether you need a washable flat emulsion for ceilings or a hard-wearing eggshell for skirting boards, each batch is prepared with care and precision.',
