	'k11afabc0' => 'How do you prepare for an in-store colour consultation?',
	'k129aa9ef' => 'Click and collect at our Verfstraat shop is completely free of charge. Tins of mixed paint are prepared and ready to collect in 2 hours. If you prefer local delivery, orders placed before 15:00 Tuesday to Saturday are delivered across Rotterdam the next working day by Yusuf Demir. Wallpaper rolls not currently in stock are ordered in 3–5 working days directly from our weavers. Shop hours are Tuesday to Friday 09:00–18:00 and Saturday 09:00–17:00, with our Saturday swatch table running from 10:00 to 13:00. We are closed Sunday and Monday.',
