	'kc0fcb78c' => 'We produce three dedicated paint finishes on our Verfstraat tinting machine. House Matt is our flat matt, washable emulsion for walls and ceilings, offering coverage of about 12 m² per litre per coat and priced at €58 for a 2.5 L tin. Wood &amp; Metal Eggshell provides a low sheen finish designed for skirting, doors, and radiators, priced at €34 for 1 L. Lime Wash is a mineral finish creating a soft cloudy texture with coverage of about 8 m² per litre, priced at €46 for 2.5 L. Sample pots of any colour can be mixed to order in 100 ml jars for €6.',
