	'kcf11555f' => 'Our wallpaper collection comprises two carefully chosen textures. Linen-Weave Wallpaper is a paste-the-wall paper with a tactile woven texture, supplied in rolls measuring 10.05 × 0.52 m for €72. Grasscloth Wallpaper features hand-woven natural fibre on paper backing, supplied in rolls measuring 5.5 × 0.91 m for €138. Wallpaper not in stock is ordered in 3–5 working days. Colour matching at our counter is always free. For full-home schemes, in-home colour match visits are €45, which is fully deducted from orders over €200. Mixed paint is ready to collect in 2 hours, with delivery across Rotterdam costing €9 or free over €150.',
