	'kd5ae848d' => 'Join our monthly colour dispatch for practical trade notes, pigment observations, and upcoming workshop dates at Verfstraat 18. Sent once a month, calmly and without marketing noise.',
	'kd92aa329' => 'Founded by Ines Valk on Verfstraat, with a mixing counter from the first week.',
	'kda559fb3' => 'What topics are covered in our core articles?',
	'kdbd2c1d0' => 'Our complete price list covers six core products and three workshop services. House Matt 2.5 L is €58 (flat matt, washable, walls and ceilings, about 12 m² per litre per coat). Wood &amp; Metal Eggshell 1 L is €34 (low sheen, skirting, doors, radiators). Lime Wash 2.5 L is €46 (mineral, soft cloudy finish, about 8 m² per litre). Sample Pot 100 ml is €6. Linen-Weave Wallpaper (10.05 × 0.52 m) is €72 per roll. Grasscloth Wallpaper (5.5 × 0.91 m) is €138 per roll. Colour match at the counter is free. In-home colour match visits are €45, deducted from orders over €200. Delivery in Rotterdam is €9, free over €150. Click and collect is free.',
	'ke01af097' => 'Unopened stock can come back within 14 days. Mixed paint is not returnable.',
	'ke17225ce' => 'Reaching our shop is straightforward using city public transport. Take tram line 8 to the Verfstraat stop. From the tram platform, walk two minutes down the street to number 18, where our workshop windows and entrance face the pavement. Bicycle stands are available directly outside our door for cycling visitors. If you are picking up heavy paint tins or long rolls of wallpaper by car, short-stay curb loading is accessible directly in front of the trade counter during business hours.',
	'ke27086b0' => 'Gives the first-Saturday demonstrations of brush, roller and lime wash.',
