	'ke47febb9' => 'What colour match services and fees apply?',
	'ke4f86a05' => 'Chapter three',
	'ke5c5784a' => 'Founded in 2009 by former decorator Ines Valk, Toso Paints is rooted in a quiet conviction: a colour is chosen against the room, not the chip.',
	'ke657fc4c' => 'Unopened standard stock items, including unopened wallpaper rolls in their original batch wrapping, may be returned within 14 days of purchase for an exchange or refund upon presentation of your receipt. Because custom paint is tinted specifically to your individual recipe, mixed paint is not returnable. We state this plainly so clients can make confident decisions by testing a €6 sample pot first. If you need advice regarding quantities or finishes prior to ordering, speak with Yusuf Demir at our counter or call +31 10 000 1809.',
	'ke85001f8' => 'Trade counter, orders and delivery',
	'ke86857ed' => 'Toso Paints is located at Verfstraat 18, 3011 Rotterdam, Netherlands. Our shop is open Tuesday to Friday from 09:00 to 18:00, and Saturday from 09:00 to 17:00. The swatch table runs every Saturday from 10:00 to 13:00. We are closed Sunday and Monday. For orders, technical queries, or to arrange trade collections, contact Yusuf Demir and the team by telephone at +31 10 000 1809 or send an email to hello@tosopaints.example. We reply to all messages during our standard counter working hours.',
	'ke8e18f4a' => 'No results. Try a shorter word.',
	'ke9852b65' => 'Chapter two',
	'keba053a5' => 'Orders placed before 15:00 (Tue–Sat) are delivered in Rotterdam the next working day. Wallpaper not in stock is ordered in 3–5 working days.',
	'kebe32945' => 'Back to the shop',
	'kecb59f97' => 'Nothing on the shelf right now. Ask at the counter and we will order it in.',
	'kedf1e15c' => 'Finish / detail',
	'kf0929274' => 'Visit the shop',
	'kf10b8a8c' => 'TOSO PAINTS',
	'kf1f5e96f' => 'Amara Osei',
	'kf2e7336e' => 'What does a typical working day look like at Verfstraat 18?',
	'kf36feb5e' => 'Paste-the-wall, woven texture · roll 10.05 × 0.52 m',
	'kf43695b7' => 'Paper is ordered by the roll <br> and the batch.',
	'kf613f5bc' => 'Ines Valk, founder',
	'kf7c9466d' => 'Looks after trade orders, collections and the next-day delivery run.',
	'kf815a954' => 'Doors open at 09:00 as trade decorators arrive to collect tins mixed earlier that morning. Yusuf Demir reviews dispatches while Lena Brandt sets out tinting recipes and checks pigment levels. Throughout the afternoon, homeowners arrive with fragments of brick, floor tiles, and curtain fabric. Drawdown cards are drawn with steel bars, dried for 20 minutes on the window rack, and inspected under shifting skies. On Saturdays between 10:00 and 13:00, the tempo quickens as Mei Lindgren welcomes customers to the swatch table to paint trial boards and discuss room palettes.',
	'kf846063c' => 'Bring a photo of the wall, an old paint flake, or a fabric swatch to our Verfstraat counter. We will help you select and mix the right shade under natural window light.',
	'kfaafa2cd' => 'Where is the shop located and what are the opening hours?',
	'kfb27591c' => 'The recipe number goes on the lid and stays on file for re-orders.',
	'kfb6a0a84' => 'SAT 10:00',
	'kfe7afdb2' => 'Yusuf Demir',
	'kfee167e2' => 'Our archive holds hundreds of practical cases from across the city. In a north kitchen in Kralingen, a green matched from a phone photo was mixed one step warmer after the drawdown check by the window. For a grasscloth hallway in Delfshaven, four rolls were calculated for a stair wall with a sloped ceiling, with one spare roll kept from the exact same batch. In a rental flat in Noord, lime wash was applied over old emulsion after a primer coat, tested with two sample boards painted at our Saturday swatch table first.',
	'kffa2157b' => 'Bring a photo of the wall.',
